jetos · a friendly front end for your config.jet system

  usage  jetos <command> [--no-color]

  check         evaluate + validate the config (no changes)
  list          show the merged system tree
  diff          what would change vs the live generation
  switch        build it and make it live (writes a generation)
  generations   list save-slots for your whole machine
  sync          re-wire modules/ into the import-tree
  help          this text

  add a program: drop it in a modules/ file and run jetos switch
